## Description

This detection identifies the execution of the **Windows Command Prompt (cmd.exe)** using **Microsoft Sysmon Event ID 1 (Process Creation)**.

Command Prompt is a legitimate Windows administration utility but is also heavily abused by attackers for executing reconnaissance commands, launching malware, creating persistence mechanisms, and running Living-off-the-Land Binaries (LOLBins).

Monitoring `cmd.exe` execution provides defenders with visibility into command-line activity that may indicate malicious behavior.

